Deliver cutting-edge solutions tailored to meet business needs through technical expertise and best practices.

Requirements:

Mid-level
Over 4 years - Ability to analyze, develop, implement, and customize Microsoft Dynamics 365-based solutions;
Expertise in defining both functional and non-functional requirements;
Strong hands-on experience developing custom Microsoft Dynamics 365 UI components using React and Power Apps Component Framework (PCF);
Competence in developing design specifications and presenting/demonstrating solutions (live, documented, and presented) to stakeholders;
Experience working within agile teams to implement Dynamics 365 solutions;
Proficiency in using out-of-the-box components and modules;
Strong communication skills for effective client interaction;
Experience in Dynamics 365 Project Operations;
Business fluency in English (mandatory for speaking and writing);

If you’re interested in this job please send your CV in English to career@decskill.com with reference “SS / D3D)”

